      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And it shall be when the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.13.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.13.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall bring thee into the land of the Canaanites, and the Hittites, and the Amorites, and the Hivites, and the Jebusites, which he sware unto thy fathers to give thee, a land flowing with milk and honey, that thou shalt keep this service in this month.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seven days thou shalt eat unleavened bread, and in the seventh day",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.13.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.13.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a feast to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.13.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.13.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unleavened bread shall be eaten seven days; and there shall no leavened bread be seen with thee, neither shall there be leaven seen with thee in all thy quarters.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And thou shalt shew thy son in that day, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "This is done",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.13.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.13.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "because of that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.13.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.13.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.13.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.13.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "did unto me when I came forth out of Egypt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it shall be for a sign unto thee upon thine hand, and for a memorial between thine eyes, that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD's",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.13.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.13.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "law may be in thy mouth: for with a strong hand hath the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.13.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.13.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "brought thee out of Egypt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt therefore keep this ordinance in his season from year to year.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
